      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可、可是，比萨你也要在模拟比赛中对战玫瑰帝国她们吧？\n那可不是能随随便便应付的对手。你哪有空管我啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d31acec59e72d32be008495be72ae183ac102c1f5e1f742ba94344f4f28b580",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
