      "uid": "zhcn:a5daab3ae6fb0a9d9ca78a39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要一边帮助朋友一边获胜，她的对手们可没那么好对付。\n而且既然她自己也要以出道为目标，就绝不能在这上面疏忽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce87021aa9aed553f9e3cbf5aee1dac553312fc935b5cc84694efaf6c9a19fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
